# Opts (actions/actions_opts.kbd)
**opts + 1**        -- Set Quiet Profile
**opts + 2**        -- Set Balanced Profile
**opts + 3**        -- Set Performance Profile
**opts + rsft + k** -- Restart Kwanata
**opts + lsft + q** -- Restart System
**opts + rsft + q** -- Shutdown System
**opts + p**        -- Print Screen
**opts + lsft + p** -- Print Window
**opts + lsft + k** -- Sync And Reload Kanata
**opts + k**        -- Reload Kanata
**opts + d**        -- Debug Message
**opts + q**        -- Sleep System
